---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import styles from '../styles/legal.module.css';
---

<Layout
  title="Disclaimer | WitrQuran"
  description="Disclaimer for WitrQuran, a free open source Quran listening platform."
  noindex={true}
>
  <div class={styles.pageContainer}>
    <nav class={styles.breadcrumb} aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span>Disclaimer</span>
    </nav>

    <header class={styles.header}>
      <h1 class={styles.title}>Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class={styles.lastUpdated}>Last Updated: September 27, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class={styles.content}>
      <p>WitrQuran is a free open source Quran listening platform created to make listening to the Quran simple fast and free from unnecessary distractions</p>

      <p>The Quran is the Book of Almighty Allah SWT</p>

      <p>WitrQuran does not claim to create author modify or own the Quran</p>

      <p>The platform is simply a tool created to make listening to the Quran easier for everyone by the will of Allah SWT</p>

      <h2>1. Quranic Content</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran provides access to Quranic Arabic audio for listening</p>

      <p>The Quran is the revelation of Almighty Allah SWT and is not the intellectual property of WitrQuran</p>

      <p>WitrQuran does not claim ownership over the Quranic text or the religious message of the Quran</p>

      <h2>2. Recitation Audio</h2>

      <p>The recitation audio available through WitrQuran is provided through an external source and is not recorded or produced by WitrQuran</p>

      <p>WitrQuran does not claim ownership of third party recitation recordings</p>

      <p>Any rights associated with such recordings remain with their respective owners or licensors</p>

      <h2>3. No Religious Authority</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran is a Quran listening platform</p>

      <p>It is not a religious authority Islamic institution or scholarly organization</p>

      <p>WitrQuran does not provide:</p>

      <ul>
        <li>Fatwas</li>
        <li>Islamic legal rulings</li>
        <li>Personalized religious advice</li>
        <li>Religious counseling</li>
        <li>Scholarly interpretation</li>
      </ul>

      <p>If you require religious guidance or a ruling you should consult a qualified and trusted Islamic scholar</p>

      <h2>4. No Interpretation or Translation</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran currently focuses on Quranic Arabic listening</p>

      <p>We do not provide our own translation interpretation or commentary on the Quran</p>

      <p>Nothing on WitrQuran should be understood as an independent interpretation of the Quran</p>

      <h2>5. Accuracy</h2>

      <p>We make reasonable efforts to provide a reliable listening experience</p>

      <p>However technical issues may occur including:</p>

      <ul>
        <li>Audio interruptions</li>
        <li>Incorrect playback</li>
        <li>Temporary availability issues</li>
        <li>Technical errors</li>
        <li>Third party service interruptions</li>
      </ul>

      <p>If you discover an issue please report it so that we can investigate and correct it where possible</p>

      <h2>6. Third Party Services</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran may rely on external services to deliver website functionality and Quran audio</p>

      <p>The availability and operation of these external services are outside our direct control</p>

      <p>WitrQuran is not responsible for changes outages or failures caused by third party services</p>

      <h2>7. External Links</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran may link to external websites including the WitrQuran GitHub repository and external services</p>

      <p>External websites operate independently and may have their own terms privacy policies and practices</p>

      <p>We are not responsible for the content or practices of external websites</p>

      <h2>8. Open Source</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran is open source and released under the MIT License</p>

      <p>The availability of the source code does not mean that every third party resource used by the platform is owned by WitrQuran or released under the MIT License</p>

      <p>Third party content may be subject to separate rights and licenses</p>

      <p><a href="https://github.com/witrfaruk/WitrQuran?utm_source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View WitrQuran on GitHub</a></p>

      <h2>9. No Guarantee</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran is provided on an <strong>as-is</strong> and <strong>as-available</strong> basis</p>

      <p>We do not guarantee that the website or audio will always be:</p>

      <ul>
        <li>Available</li>
        <li>Uninterrupted</li>
        <li>Error free</li>
        <li>Compatible with every device</li>
        <li>Free from technical problems</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>10. Limitation of Responsibility</h2>

      <p>To the extent permitted by applicable law WitrQuran and its creator shall not be responsible for losses or damages resulting from the use or inability to use the website or third party services</p>

      <p>Nothing in this Disclaimer excludes rights or protections that cannot legally be excluded</p>

      <h2>11. Changes</h2>

      <p>We may update this Disclaimer when the website functionality content or applicable requirements change</p>

      <p>The <strong>Last Updated</strong> date will be changed whenever this page is updated</p>

      <h2>12. Contact</h2>

      <p>If you have questions about this Disclaimer or WitrQuran please contact:</p>

      <p><strong>Md Faruk Abdulla</strong></p>

      <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:witrfaruk@proton.me">witrfaruk@proton.me</a></p>

      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/witrfaruk?utm_source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/witrfaruk?utm_source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a></li>
      </ul>

      <p><a href="https://github.com/witrfaruk/WitrQuran?utm_source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WitrQuran GitHub Repository</a></p>

      <p><strong>The Quran is from Almighty Allah SWT. WitrQuran is simply a tool created to make listening easier for everyone by His will.</strong></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
